    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0943" n="873" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg873"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. De Long.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-04-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 3, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Your despatch of the 20th February (No. 3)
                    has been received.</p>
                <p>It gives an account of the arrest of two of the crew of the pirate Sumter, and
                    their detention, with a view of their being sent to the United States.</p>
                <p>I have subsequently learned, though informally, that the persons thus arrested
                    have been despatched to this country.</p>
                <p>The French minister residing at this capital mentioned to me, informally,
                    yesterday, that he was charged with a communication to me upon the same subject
                    by his government.</p>
                <p>For this reason I defer presenting the matter to the notice of the President
                    until the promised statement of Mr. Thouvenel shall have been received.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James De Long,</hi> Esq., <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi>,<hi rendition="#italic">
                        Tangier.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
